      "comment": "INDIAN PRINCE (2) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when third (30.57) in a Grade 5 over 525m at this track. Will find this more suitable and can atone. ASTON CASTLE (8) unwanted in betting but showed good early dash and led until late, finishing second and beaten 1.75 lengths (30.52) at this track in a Grade 5 over 525m. Will give a great sight again. IT'S LATE (1) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 525m (30.62). Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. WINDORAH (6) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
